  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0d12;
      --surface: #14171f;
      --surface-2: #1c2030;
      --text: #e8ebf2;
      --muted: #9aa3b5;
      --accent: #7c5cff;
      --accent-2: #00d1b2;
      --radius: 14px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(11, 13, 18, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-2);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 68px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .logo span { color: var(--accent-2); }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #5a3be0);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.35);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--surface-2);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 120px 0 100px;
      text-align: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.25), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, rgba(0, 209, 178, 0.12), transparent 50%);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      color: var(--accent-2);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 .gradient {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: 96px 0; }

    .section-label {
      color: var(--accent-2);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .section-intro {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    /* About */
    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-text p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .steps {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .step {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--surface-2);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .step-badge {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .step h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .step p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Offerings */
    .offerings { background: var(--surface); }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--surface-2);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 36px 28px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .card-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.97rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card ul {
      list-style: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.93rem;
    }

    .card li {
      padding: 6px 0 6px 22px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .card li::before {
      content: "→";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--accent-2);
    }

    /* Contact */
    .contact {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-box {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,92,255,0.18), rgba(0,209,178,0.10));
      border: 1px solid var(--surface-2);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 64px 32px;
    }

    .contact-box p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin: 16px auto 36px;
      max-width: 480px;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--surface-2);
      padding: 36px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .disclaimer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #6b7385;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero { padding: 90px 0 70px; }
      section { padding: 72px 0; }
      .contact-box { padding: 48px 24px; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <div class="logo">Fade the <span>Public</span></div>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#offerings">What I Offer</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Predictions · Markets · Sports</span>
        <h1>Fade the <span class="gradient">Public</span></h1>
        <p>Predictions on markets and sports, built on an order of operations framework. Structured thinking over hot takes.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('offerings').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">See What I Offer</button>
          <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="document.getElementById('about').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">How It Works</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- About -->
    <section id="about">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
          <div class="section-label">About</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Order matters.</h2>
          <p>Most predictions fail because people skip steps. They react to headlines, follow the crowd, and chase whatever is loudest. Fade the Public is built on the opposite approach: a repeatable, ordered process that evaluates every market and matchup the same way every time.</p>
          <p>Just like solving an equation, the sequence is what keeps you honest. Gather the context first, then measure the edge, weigh the odds, and only then make the call.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-badge">1</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Parentheses: Gather Context</h3>
              <p>Isolate what actually matters before forming any opinion.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-badge">2</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Exponents: Find the Edge</h3>
              <p>Identify where the crowd is mispricing risk or information.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-badge">3</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Multiply & Divide: Weigh the Odds</h3>
              <p>Quantify probabilities and size the conviction accordingly.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-badge">4</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Add & Subtract: Make the Call</h3>
              <p>Bring it together, state the prediction, and track the result.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Offerings -->
    <section id="offerings" class="offerings">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">What I Offer</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Predictions, the ordered way.</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">Every pick follows the same framework, so you can see the reasoning behind each call and learn the process along with the result.</p>

        <div class="cards">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">📈</div>
            <h3>Market Predictions</h3>
            <p>Structured forecasts on financial and prediction markets, with the reasoning laid out step by step.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Market outlooks and calls</li>
              <li>Framework breakdowns</li>
              <li>Post-mortem reviews</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">🏆</div>
            <h3>Sports Predictions</h3>
            <p>Game-by-game analysis that filters out noise and focuses on the factors that actually move outcomes.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Weekly matchup breakdowns</li>
              <li>Edge-focused picks</li>
              <li>Season tracking</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">🧮</div>
            <h3>The Framework Guide</h3>
            <p>Learn the order of operations system and apply it to your own predictions and decisions.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Step-by-step methodology</li>
              <li>Worked examples</li>
              <li>Templates and checklists</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section id="contact" class="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="contact-box">
          <div class="section-label">Contact</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Let's talk.</h2>
          <p>Have a question about the framework, a market you want my take on, or a partnership idea? Reach out.</p>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="alert('Coming Soon!')">Get in Touch</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

